{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2021-11-30 12:30:00', 'title': "HONEYWELL QUANTUM SOLUTIONS AND CAMBRIDGE QUANTUM COMPLETE BUSINESS COMBINATION TO FORM WORLD'S LARGEST, MOST ADVANCED STANDALONE QUANTUM COMPANY", 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., NOV. 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT HONEYWELL QUANTUM SOLUTIONS (HQS) AND CAMBRIDGE QUANTUM (CQ), TWO GLOBAL LEADERS IN QUANTUM COMPUTING AND TECHNOLOGY, RECEIVED REGULATORY APPROVAL AND COMPLETED THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED BUSINESS COMBINATION.'}